---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { site } from '../config/site';
---
<BaseLayout title="Shipping, returns & privacy" description="Canada shipping, Toronto pickup, custom proofs, returns and file privacy at Layerline Studio.">
  <article class="container policies">
    <p class="mono-m kicker">Policies · Updated November 4, 2026</p><h1 class="display-l">Shipping, returns & privacy</h1>
    <h2 class="display-xs" id="shipping">Shipping & pickup</h2>
    <p>We ship within Canada only. Tracked shipping is ${site.shippingCanada} CAD, free on orders of ${site.freeShippingFrom} CAD or more before tax and shipping. Shipping time is separate from production time. We confirm any timing change before printing.</p>
    <p>Free pickup is in Toronto’s east end, by appointment after your ready email. We send the address privately. Please wait for a confirmed pickup time; there is no walk-in storefront.</p>
    <p>Made-to-order work normally takes 5–7 business days after proof approval. Stock items ship in 1–2 business days when stock is confirmed. Carrier dates are estimates, not guarantees. Tell us about a deadline before ordering.</p>
    <h2 class="display-xs" id="returns">Returns, mistakes & damage</h2>
    <p>Email <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a> before returning anything. Unused, non-personalised stock items can be returned within 30 days of delivery. You pay return postage; original shipping is not refunded unless we made an error or the item is faulty.</p>
    <p>For personalised or custom work, we send a proof for approval before printing. One proof and one revision are included. Please check spelling, size, colour and fit. Once you approve and printing starts, change-of-mind returns are not available. Contact us before approval if you need to cancel; we explain any design work already completed before charging for it.</p>
    <p>If an order is faulty, wrong or damaged, email your order number and photos as soon as possible, ideally within 14 days. Keep the packaging for shipping claims. We will arrange a suitable remake or refund and cover required return shipping. These policies do not limit your rights under applicable consumer law.</p>
    <h2 class="display-xs" id="terms">Custom work & safe use</h2>
    <p>Custom quotes start at $25 CAD. We quote the full scope and applicable tax before payment: 100% upfront under $60, otherwise a 50% deposit with the balance due before shipping or pickup. Rush work is subject to capacity and adds 25%. Printing starts only after written proof approval.</p>
    <p>You must own or have permission to use uploaded photos, logos and designs. We do not print weapons or weapon parts, keys, unauthorised characters or logos, faces without consent, or medical, vehicle-safety or load-bearing parts. Products are for adults. Nothing is a toy or intended for children.</p>
    <p>Brand names only describe fit. Layerline Studio is not affiliated with or endorsed by those brands. Fine layer lines are normal. PLA is for indoor use away from heat and sun. Food-contact certification is not offered.</p>
    <p>LED products must use only cUL/CSA/cETL-approved USB modules and a matching approved power supply. We confirm the module and its approval before production. We do not wire mains power. Do not use damaged cables or leave lights covered or unattended.</p>
    <h2 class="display-xs" id="tax">Prices & tax</h2>
    <p>All prices are CAD. Any applicable tax is shown before you pay. Shipping and approved add-ons are shown separately. A quote or proof does not authorise an extra charge without your agreement.</p>
    <h2 class="display-xs" id="privacy">Privacy & uploaded files</h2>
    <p>Layerline Studio uses your contact details, address, order options and files to quote, make, deliver and support your order. Stripe processes payments and stores payment records; we do not receive full card numbers. Files and production records are stored privately in Cloudflare R2. Request and order alerts are sent to the studio inbox. These providers may process data outside Canada.</p>
    <p>Artwork uploads, unpaid checkout drafts and quote requests are scheduled for deletion after 90 days. Keep your originals; a later reorder may need a new upload. Paid order and supplier records are kept for at least six years for bookkeeping and product traceability. We keep required transaction records even if you ask to delete artwork.</p>
    <p>Email <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a> to request access, corrections or deletion. We verify the request before releasing or removing personal information. We do not publish customer photos or reviews without permission, sell personal details or automatically add requesters to a mailing list.</p>
    <p>The bag and unfinished custom form use storage on your device. Clear them on a shared device. Basic Cloudflare traffic measurement, when enabled, does not use advertising cookies. Optional Google or advertising tracking stays off until consent and account setup are complete.</p>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
<style>.policies{max-width:820px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:18px;padding-block:72px 120px}.policies h2{margin-top:24px}.policies p{line-height:1.7}.policies a{text-decoration:underline}</style>
